# API-43 AC-011 secret scan after the real update and the user's real sign-out/sign-in (Codex, Grok) in iso-56551-47f6
# command: python3 scan-real.py <instance data root> <instance desktop log> <API-40/41/42 API answers>  (scanner source below); date 2026-10-20T13:04:19Z
# patterns: openai-auth-url, xai-auth-url, oauth-params (code_challenge/code_verifier/state=/code=), device-code, tokens (access/refresh/id token, Bearer), api-key-like (sk-/xai-), email
